for(const id of ['filterAirline','filterAirport','filterStops','filterMode','filterBudget'])$(id).addEventListener('change',render);$('clearFilters').onclick=()=>{for(const id of ['filterAirline','filterAirport','filterStops','filterMode'])$(id).value='';$('filterBudget').checked=false;render();};tabbar.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const f=flights[Number(b.dataset.index)];if(f)pick(f);});sort.value=(priority==='time'?timeKey:costKey);sort.addEventListener('change',render);tabbar.hidden=false;out.querySelector('h2').textContent='Compare your trip options';render();$('searchPanel').hidden=true;document.querySelector('.hero').hidden=true;out.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
